+/**
+ * What the player has worked out about Cobra's network, region by region.
+ *
+ * It reports only what has been found. A site counts once its base is discovered, and the two
+ * figures are what those known sites are worth per month - not what the region is actually
+ * holding, which the player has no way of knowing. So the screen sharpens as the player finds
